    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3d89c8aeb12b815b79c4a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主看起来积累了不少疲劳。\n她似乎还需要一段时间才能恢复状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2ec48b225ed5a7d2068ed376edfd7eeae735207dbc0f660e0514cd60885d8d",
