      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时有一间长久没人使用的大储藏室……。\n我很在意里面积满灰尘，\n便去打扫了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19da3693b93c630472abcf998029b91322b9b45ea59bc736be93913f0f450e1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
