      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的，一个人。\n因为脏了所以打扫，事情仅此而已……\n我觉得没必要特意告诉别人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0da78886d1a05d6fbc931513842b196620a6bb230ed1ebe6ee415f3358b49bf",
